
# Developer Portfolio

A responsive personal portfolio built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

## Features

- Responsive layout for desktop and mobile
- Mobile navigation menu
- About and technical skills sections
- Featured project cards
- Email and GitHub links
- Dynamic copyright year
- Active section navigation

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Git and GitHub

## Run Locally

1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Open `index.html` using Live Server.

## Future Improvements

- Add completed full-stack projects
- Connect a contact form to a backend API
- Deploy the website publicly

